<title>UK: ING unit sets A$100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING unit sets A$100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros Bank and ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING MERCANTILE MUTUAL BANK LTD</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ING BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    13.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.11    PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX/AMS   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
